== Usage ==
=== Note blocks ===
Chiseled resin bricks can be placed under [[note block]]s to produce "bass drum" sounds.

=== Sulfur cube ===
{{In development|drop=Chaos Cubed|section=1}}
[[Sulfur cube]]s have the ability to absorb blocks of resin, either through picking them up or being interacted with them. This provides the rubber ball/bouncy effect{{only|bedrock|short=1}} or the golf ball/fast flat {{only|java|short=1}} to the mob when hitting it.

